From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: premohq <48417750+premohq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 01:48:16 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] PS5-ECAM's Switch 2 side: the core is Lichii's all-in-one

zortos293/Lichii at 9b1a32dbb1 (test/all-in-one-mt), Eglantine's continuation by its author: 956 commits on
the core this port pinned, none of its own left out. The port moved onto it: its three core patches again
(an extracted dump's layers beside Lichii's own fallback for a base with no RomFS; the U16 F2I modifiers with
Lichii's check of the small form's other bits), and tools/lichii-anchors.json for the anchors of
prepare-vulkan-port.py whose code moved. Left out with the code they were on: the draw dispatch check mask
(Lichii's SubmissionPolicy budgets instead), the compute pipeline's first-use probe and the dynamic state's
line. EDEN_NX2_PARALLEL_RECORD stays off, as its default is.
